---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../../config/site";

const phoneHref = site.contact.phone.replace(/[^\d+]/g, "");
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Moving Out of Illinois | AJ Tayfel Relocation Services"
  description="Planning a move from Chicagoland? Coordinate your Illinois home sale and connect with an appropriately licensed real estate professional in your destination market."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Relocation From Illinois</p>

      <h1>
        Your next move<br />
        starts here.
      </h1>

      <div class="hero-bottom">
        <p class="hero-lede">
          Selling a home in Illinois while moving to another state creates two
          real estate processes that need to work together. I can help manage
          the Illinois side and coordinate an introduction to an appropriately
          licensed real estate professional at your destination.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a
            class="button-premium primary"
            href="/relocation/chicago-to-southwest-florida/"
          >
            Explore Florida Relocation
          </a>

          <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">
            Start a Conversation →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="intro-section">
    <div class="container intro-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">A Coordinated Approach</p>

        <h2>
          One move.<br />
          Two real estate markets.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="intro-copy">
        <p>
          Interstate relocation is not simply an Illinois sale followed by an
          unrelated purchase somewhere else.
        </p>

        <p>
          Your listing timeline, equity, financing, destination search, moving
          schedule, and next closing may all affect each other. Planning those
          pieces together can create a clearer path from your current home to
          the next one.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container process">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Plan the Illinois side</h3>
        <p>
          Start with your current property, preparation needs, timing, and
          what the Illinois transaction needs to accomplish.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Define the destination</h3>
        <p>
          Clarify where you're considering moving, what you expect to buy,
          and which local questions need to be answered.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Connect both markets</h3>
        <p>
          When destination representation is needed, I can coordinate an
          introduction so both sides understand the larger relocation plan.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="destinations-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Relocation Destinations</p>

        <h2>
          Where are you headed?
        </h2>

        <p>
          Start with the destination that best matches your plans. These
          guides are built specifically for Chicago-area homeowners managing
          an Illinois property while preparing for an interstate move.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="destination-grid">
        <a
          class="destination-feature florida"
          href="/relocation/chicago-to-southwest-florida/"
        >
          <div class="destination-top">
            <span>01</span>
            <span class="arrow">↗</span>
          </div>

          <div class="destination-content">
            <p class="destination-label">Featured Relocation Market</p>

            <h3>
              Chicago to<br />
              Southwest Florida
            </h3>

            <p>
              Explore Fort Myers, Cape Coral, Naples, Bonita Springs, Estero,
              and the planning questions that come with coordinating an
              Illinois sale and Florida purchase.
            </p>
          </div>

          <strong>Explore Southwest Florida</strong>
        </a>

        <a
          class="destination-feature indiana"
          href="/relocation/chicago-to-northwest-indiana/"
        >
          <div class="destination-top">
            <span>02</span>
            <span class="arrow">↗</span>
          </div>

          <div class="destination-content">
            <p class="destination-label">Cross-Border Relocation</p>

            <h3>
              Chicago to<br />
              Northwest Indiana
            </h3>

            <p>
              Explore a move into Lake County, Porter County, and surrounding
              communities while remaining closely connected to Chicagoland.
            </p>
          </div>

          <strong>Explore Northwest Indiana</strong>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="florida-preview">
    <div class="container preview-grid">
      <div class="preview-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Southwest Florida</p>

        <h2>
          A growing relocation resource for Illinois homeowners.
        </h2>

        <a
          class="text-link"
          href="/relocation/chicago-to-southwest-florida/"
        >
          View the full Florida relocation hub →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="preview-links">
        <a href="/relocation/chicago-to-fort-myers/">
          <span>Destination Guide</span>
          <strong>Fort Myers</strong>
          <b>→</b>
        </a>

        <a href="/relocation/chicago-to-cape-coral/">
          <span>Destination Guide</span>
          <strong>Cape Coral</strong>
          <b>→</b>
        </a>

        <a href="/relocation/selling-illinois-home-before-moving-to-florida/">
          <span>Planning Guide</span>
          <strong>Selling Before Moving to Florida</strong>
          <b>→</b>
        </a>

        <a href="/relocation/should-you-sell-illinois-house-before-buying-in-florida/">
          <span>Planning Guide</span>
          <strong>Sell First or Buy First?</strong>
          <b>→</b>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="aj-section">
    <div class="container aj-grid">
      <div class="portrait-wrap">
        <img
          src="/images/aj-headshot.png"
          alt="AJ Tayfel, REALTOR®"
          width="900"
          height="1125"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="aj-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Your Illinois-Side Resource</p>

        <h2>Start with AJ.</h2>

        <p class="aj-lede">
          The destination may change. Your Illinois property is where the
          relocation plan begins.
        </p>

        <p>
          I help homeowners throughout the Chicago western suburbs plan and
          handle the Illinois real estate side of an interstate move.
        </p>

        <p>
          When you need representation in another market, I can help identify
          and introduce you to an appropriately licensed real estate
          professional based on the location and type of help you need.
        </p>

        <div class="aj-actions">
          <a class="button-premium light-button" href="/contact/">
            Plan My Move
          </a>

          <a class="direct-link" href={`tel:${phoneHref}`}>
            Call {site.contact.phone}
          </a>

          <a class="direct-link" href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>
            Email AJ
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing-section">
    <div class="container closing-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Not Sure Where to Start?</p>

        <h2>
          Start with your current home and your timeline.
        </h2>

        <p>
          You do not need to have every detail figured out before beginning
          the conversation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a class="button-premium primary" href="/contact/">
        Start a Conversation
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero,
  .intro-section,
  .destinations-section,
  .florida-preview,
  .aj-section,
  .closing-section {
    --ink: #102c3c;
    --ink-deep: #092432;
    --paper: #fbfaf6;
    --warm: #f2eee6;
    --line: rgba(16,44,60,.16);
    --gold: #a88b55;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 10rem) 0;
    background: var(--ink-deep);
    color: white;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 1120px;
  }

  .hero h1,
  .intro-section h2,
  .section-heading h2,
  .preview-heading h2,
  .aj-copy h2,
  .closing-section h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 900px;
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    line-height: .92;
  }

  .hero-bottom {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: end;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
  }

  .hero-lede {
    max-width: 720px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .button-premium {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 52px;
    padding: .9rem 1.55rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: transform .2s ease;
  }

  .button-premium:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .button-premium.primary {
    background: white;
    color: var(--ink-deep);
  }

  .text-link,
  .direct-link {
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: .25em;
  }

  .hero .text-link {
    color: white;
  }

  .intro-section {
    padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem) 0;
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
  }

  .intro-section h2,
  .section-heading h2,
  .preview-heading h2,
  .aj-copy h2,
  .closing-section h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.8rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
  }

  .intro-copy p {
    color: #647078;
    font-size: 1.03rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .intro-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .process {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    margin-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .process article {
    padding-top: 1.4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .process span,
  .destination-top span:first-child {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .13em;
  }

  .process h3 {
    margin: 1rem 0 .7rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .process p {
    color: #647078;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .destinations-section {
    padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem) 0;
    background: var(--warm);
  }

  .section-heading {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .section-heading > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    color: #647078;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .destination-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--line);
  }

  .destination-feature {
    min-height: 560px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    background: var(--paper);
    color: inherit;
  }

  .destination-feature:hover {
    background: white;
  }

  .destination-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .arrow {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .destination-label {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .destination-feature h3 {
    margin: .7rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.7rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .destination-feature p:not(.destination-label) {
    max-width: 500px;
    color: #647078;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .destination-feature > strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: .25em;
  }

  .florida-preview {
    padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem) 0;
    background: white;
  }

  .preview-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
  }

  .preview-heading .text-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .preview-links {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .preview-links a {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr 30px;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .preview-links span {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .preview-links strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .aj-section {
    padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem) 0;
    background: var(--ink-deep);
    color: white;
  }

  .aj-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 410px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .portrait-wrap {
    width: 360px;
    justify-self: center;
    padding: 10px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  }

  .portrait-wrap img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .aj-copy h2 {
    color: white;
  }

  .aj-copy .eyebrow {
    color: #c7ad79;
  }

  .aj-lede {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .aj-copy > p:not(.eyebrow):not(.aj-lede) {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .aj-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .light-button {
    background: white;
    color: var(--ink-deep);
  }

  .aj-actions .direct-link {
    color: white;
  }

  .closing-section {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem) 0;
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .closing-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .closing-inner > div {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .closing-inner p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: #647078;
  }

  .closing-section .button-premium.primary {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    background: var(--ink-deep);
    color: white;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-bottom,
    .intro-grid,
    .preview-grid,
    .aj-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .process {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .closing-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .destination-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .destination-feature {
      min-height: 430px;
    }

    .preview-links a {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 28px;
    }

    .preview-links span {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .portrait-wrap {
      width: min(360px, 100%);
      justify-self: start;
    }
  }
</style>
